# Paths are anchored with a leading slash on purpose.
#
# An unanchored `storage/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which
# silently excluded src/documents/storage/ — the NAS storage driver — from the
# repository. The build then failed only on a fresh checkout, which is the worst
# place to discover it.
/node_modules/
/dist/
/coverage/
/storage/
/.test-storage/
/demo-output/
.env
*.tsbuildinfo
